      "sourceTextSha256": "452cefcb4432633ae4a9a687eda4c847a400f45d11277c3967cec52177ccba9b",
      "text": "Isla Perro is a good spot for snorkelling and scuba diving. A well-preserved army boat lies at a depth of about 5–6 metres.\n\nAt low tide, you can see its rusty bow above the water. At high tide, you can snorkel around the wreck or explore it with scuba gear. Coral and fish of various sizes can be found nearby.\n\nOn the night of the new moon, you may see bioluminescence produced by small squid and plankton.",
